title: "Smart Knowledge Gap & Personalized Learning System"
abstract: >-
  An adaptive learning platform that detects concept-level knowledge gaps,
  prioritizes learning needs via prerequisite-aware ranking, and generates
  personalized learning paths. Powered by 8 machine learning models, an LLM+RAG
  assistant, and an explainable AI layer using SHAP.

